    "text": "39,704 companies inactive qarar!\nBusiness Recorder ke mutabiq SECP ne Saturday ko bataya ke 4 saal se annual returns aur/ya financial statements file na karne wali 39,704 companies ko \"Inactive by Registrar\" mark kar diya gaya hai. Ye companies overdue documents file kar ke active status wapas lene tak naye bank account nahi khol sakengi. Sab se zyada Lahore (13,927) aur Islamabad (13,859) mein hain.\nKya ye qadam sahi hai? Comment mein batayein 👇\n\nImage: AI-generated illustration.\n\n#RiseUpPakistan #SECP #Business #PakistanEconomy #PakistanNews",
